@startuml SGHC-C3-ApiGateway
title SGHC - C3: API Gateway
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #2563EB
  RoundCorner 15
}

rectangle "API Gateway (NGINX/Kong)" as Gateway {
  component "Router" as Router
  component "Security Filter\n(OIDC Validator)" as SecFilter
  component "Rate Limiter" as Limiter
  component "Metrics Exporter" as Metrics
  component "Logger / Tracer" as Logger
}

actor "Usuario / App Web" as User
User --> Router : HTTPs Requests
Router --> SecFilter : Validar token JWT (OIDC)
SecFilter --> Limiter : Controlar frecuencia
Limiter --> Logger : Registrar evento
Router --> "Microservicios SGHC" : Ruteo a API interna

note right of Gateway
Controla acceso, autentica usuarios y protege tráfico
TLS 1.3 + OIDC + rate limiting + trazas centralizadas.
end note
@enduml
